-rovinj-croatia/","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rovinj"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Eat Istrian: truffle, olive oil, malvazija","type":"experience","detail":"Shaved truffle over pasta, peppery local oil, fish from the Valdibora stalls, and malvazija or teran poured by the glass.","season":[9,10,11],"link":"https://www.istra.hr/en/experiences","evidence":{"n_sources":7,"of":14,"urls":["https://www.istra.hr/en/experiences","https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Rovinj","https://evendo.com/locations/croatia/rovinj","https://www.chasingthedonkey.com/things-to-do-in-rovinj-croatia/","https://www.batana.org/en/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Swim off the rocks below the church","type":"swim","detail":"No sand here. People climb down the flat rocks under the old town, at Balota and Cisterna, and drop straight into deep water.","season":[6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":14,"urls":["https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Rovinj","https://evendo.com/locations/croatia/rovinj","https://www.chasingthedonkey.com/things-to-do-in-rovinj-croatia/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Grisia and the old town lanes","type":"activity","detail":"The artisans' street climbs from the harbour to the church through hidden staircases and squares. Walk it early, before the day boats land.","evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":14,"urls":["https://www.earthtrekkers.com/best-things-to-do-rovinj-istria-croatia/","https://jetsettingfools.com/infatuated-with-rovinj-croatia/","https://inlovewithcroatia.com/rovinj/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Taxi boat to the archipelago islands","type":"activity","detail":"Nineteen wooded islets lie off the harbour. Small boats run all day to St Katarina and St Andrew for a swim and a shaded walk.","season":[5,6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":14,"urls":["https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Rovinj","https://evendo.com/locations/croatia/rovinj","https://www.chasingthedonkey.com/things-to-do-in-rovinj-croatia/","https://en